WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:05.126
Plant cells have a wall, chloroplasts and a big vacuole; animal cells don't.

2
00:00:05.926 --> 00:00:10.726
Both cells have a nucleus, a membrane, cytoplasm and mitochondria.

3
00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:17.747
Only the plant cell has chloroplasts: it makes its own food.

4
00:00:18.623 --> 00:00:23.123
A large vacuole and a rigid wall keep it firm, with no skeleton.
